#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:147
#: 6ccfaabca3d54365b01cfdacd75c8f67
msgid "\"Yaw Lock\" / \"Yaw Follow\" controls whether the mount maintains an earth-frame yaw target (aka \"lock\") or moves with the vehicle's yaw (aka \"follow\")"
